      "The typography heavily leans on 'STK Miso', a custom typeface with a monospace fallback, reinforcing a strong technical and developer-focused identity.",
      "Subtle font weight variations (e.g., 360 for H1 Display, 410 for CSS mono, 420 for CSS H2) are used to carefully balance the visual weight of the text without relying on traditional 400/500/600 steps.",
